<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>For Sana, My Love</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sacramento&family=Quicksand&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(#ffe6f0, #ffffff);
      color: #333;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    header {
      background: #ff99cc;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
      font-family: 'Sacramento', cursive;
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    .section {
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .hearts {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .heart {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: red;
      position: absolute;
      top: -10px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      animation: float 10s linear infinite;
    }
    .heart::before,
    .heart::after {
      content: '';
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: red;
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .heart::before {
      top: -10px;
      left: 0;
    }
    .heart::after {
      left: -10px;
      top: 0;
    }
    @keyframes float {
      0% {transform: translateY(0) rotate(45deg); opacity: 1;}
      100% {transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(45deg); opacity: 0;}
    }
    .poem {
      background: #fff0f5;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.8;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    audio {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1rem;
      left: 1rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hearts" id="hearts"></div>
  <header>
    For Sana, My Love 💖
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <p>
      From the moment we met, something clicked. Your smile, your laugh,
      the way you say my name—it’s all magic. This site is my little surprise for you,
      a love letter in digital form, made just for you, Sana.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>A Poem Just for You 🌹</h2>
    <div class="poem">
      In your eyes, I found my skies,<br>
      With every laugh, my spirits rise.<br>
      You are the dream I live each day,<br>
      My heart’s song in every way.<br><br>
      Through every moment, near or far,<br>
      I love you just the way you are.<br>
      Forever yours, beneath the moon’s hue,<br>
      My sweetest Sana, I cherish you. 💕
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>A Message to You 💌</h2>
    <p>
      Dear Sana, I just want you to know how deeply I care about you.
      You're the light in my life, the reason behind my smiles,
      and the person I want to share all my tomorrows with.
      I love you endlessly. 💕
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    Made with all my love for Sana ♥️
  </footer>

  <audio autoplay loop>
    <source src="https://cdn.pixabay.com/download/audio/2023/01/04/audio_78c58673b6.mp3?filename=en-nuit-videoclub-145947.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>

  <script>
    // Floating hearts animation
    const heartsContainer = document.getElementById('hearts');
    function createHeart() {
      const heart = document.createElement('div');
      heart.classList.add('heart');
      heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
      heart.style.animationDuration = 5 + Math.random() * 5 + 's';
      heartsContainer.appendChild(heart);
      setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 10000);
    }
    setInterval(createHeart, 300);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
